flowchart LR
    Confirm[Orders Confirm] --> Desired[Orders Desired Sources]
    Desired --> Prep[Orders AROMA Preparation]
    Prep --> MapCmd[Kafka Catalog Mapping Command]
    MapCmd --> Catalog[Catalog]
    Catalog --> GW[AROMA Gateway safe catalog reads]
    Catalog --> Facts[Kafka Mapping/Availability Facts]
    Facts --> Desired
    Desired --> ConvState[Convergence State]
    Observer[AROMA Observer] -->|safe GET| GW
    GW --> AROMA[AROMA]
    Observer --> Observed[Orders Observed]
    Observed --> ConvState
    ConvState --> Worker[AROMA Convergence]
    Worker -->|GET -> one mutation -> GET| GW
    Worker --> Attempts[Attempts / Fence / UnknownOutcome]
    Worker --> Observed
